sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Route
    participant PlanService as PlanGenerationService
    participant ProfileService
    participant AICoach as AICoachService
    participant VectorDB as VectorDBService
    participant ChromaDB
    participant LLM as Groq LLM
    participant WorkoutRepo as WorkoutPlanRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>+API: POST /plans/generate/workout<br/>(workout_preferences, duration_weeks)
    Note over API: JWT auth extracts user_id
    
    API->>+PlanService: generate_workout_plan(profile, preferences)
    
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over PlanService,ProfileService: Step 1: Get User Profile
        PlanService->>+ProfileService: get_profile_by_user_id(user_id)
        ProfileService->>DB: SELECT * FROM profiles
        DB-->>ProfileService: Profile data
        ProfileService-->>-PlanService: UserProfileDTO
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over PlanService,WorkoutRepo: Step 2: Check Existing Plan
        PlanService->>+WorkoutRepo: get_active_workout_plan(user_id, profile_id)
        WorkoutRepo->>+DB: SELECT * FROM workout_plans<br/>WHERE user_id = ? AND profile_id = ?<br/>AND end_date >= NOW()
        DB-->>-WorkoutRepo: Existing plan or None
        WorkoutRepo-->>-PlanService: Optional[WorkoutPlanDTO]
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 240)
        Note over PlanService,LLM: Step 3: AI Generation with RAG
        PlanService->>+AICoach: generate_workout_plan(profile, preferences, existing_plan)
        
        par Build Enhanced RAG Query
            Note over AICoach: Construct context-aware query
            AICoach->>AICoach: query = "workout plan {focus} {difficulty}<br/>fitness level: {activity_level}<br/>injuries: {injuries}<br/>medical: {conditions}<br/>goal: {fitness_goal}"
        end
        
        AICoach->>+VectorDB: get_context(query, k=5)
        
        rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
            Note over VectorDB,ChromaDB: Semantic Search
            VectorDB->>VectorDB: Load embeddings model<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
            VectorDB->>VectorDB: Embed query → 384-dim vector
            
            VectorDB->>+ChromaDB: similarity_search(query_embedding, k=5)
            Note over ChromaDB: Search 1944 document chunks<br/>from ACSM, NSCA, WHO, etc.
            ChromaDB-->>-VectorDB: Top 5 relevant chunks with metadata
        end
        
        VectorDB->>VectorDB: Log retrieved documents:<br/>- Source URLs<br/>- Titles<br/>- Categories<br/>- Organizations
        VectorDB-->>-AICoach: Concatenated context (~15,000 chars)
        
        AICoach->>AICoach: Build comprehensive prompt:<br/>- User profile context<br/>- Workout preferences<br/>- RAG knowledge context<br/>- Existing plan (if updating)<br/>- Safety instructions
        
        AICoach->>+LLM: chat.completions.create()<br/>Model: llama-3.3-70b<br/>Temp: 0.0, Max tokens: 4000
        Note over LLM: Generate JSON workout plan:<br/>- Plan metadata<br/>- {N} workout days<br/>- Exercises with sets/reps<br/>- Safety modifications
        LLM-->>-AICoach: JSON response
        
        AICoach->>AICoach: Parse JSON response<br/>Clean markdown blocks
        AICoach->>AICoach: Convert to WorkoutPlanDTO<br/>with exercises
        AICoach-->>-PlanService: WorkoutPlanDTO
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over PlanService,DB: Step 4: Persist to Database
        
        alt Updating existing plan
            PlanService->>+WorkoutRepo: update_workout_plan(plan_id, new_data)
            Note over WorkoutRepo: Delete old exercises
            WorkoutRepo->>DB: DELETE FROM exercises<br/>WHERE workout_day_id IN (...)
            Note over WorkoutRepo: Update plan & insert new data
            WorkoutRepo->>DB: UPDATE workout_plans<br/>INSERT INTO workout_days<br/>INSERT INTO exercises
        else Creating new plan
            PlanService->>+WorkoutRepo: create_workout_plan(plan_data)
            WorkoutRepo->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            WorkoutRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO workout_plans
            WorkoutRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO workout_days (batch)
            WorkoutRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO exercises (batch)
            DB-->>WorkoutRepo: COMMIT TRANSACTION
            DB-->>-WorkoutRepo: Created plan with relationships
        end
        
        WorkoutRepo-->>-PlanService: Persisted WorkoutPlan
    end
    
    PlanService-->>-API: WorkoutPlanResponse
    API-->>-User: 201 Created<br/>{plan_id, plan_name, description,<br/>workout_days[], exercises[]}
    
    Note over User: Receives personalized<br/>workout plan based on:<br/>- Profile (injuries, goals)<br/>- Preferences (location, equipment)<br/>- Evidence-based knowledge
